(text "Channel voltage (JP01, 3-pin header + shunt):\n  1-2 = 3.3 V   2-3 = 5 V   none = channel unpowered, no pull-ups.\nPull-ups and the connector's V pin both follow JP01.\nJP02 (bridged): cut to remove the 2.2k pull-ups for devices that bring their own.\nF01 limits connector V current; D01 clamps SD/SC/V against ESD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.80 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e15b064b-f0c1-4d89-bd2c-83a1ffbeaef0"))
(text "RJ9 (4P4C) pinout: 1 SCL, 2 GND, 3 V, 4 SDA\nFor HDMI DDC: 1->15, 2->17(+20), 3->18, 4->16, channel at 5 V.\n0.1in header: GND, V, SDA, SCL.\nNot a telephone port - never connect to a phone line." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.80 118.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "38b219e1-eb66-4a2b-8672-6cd33ca598c9"))

 (embedded_fonts no))
